<title>USA: CBOT July soybeans surge on supply, technicals.</title>
<headline>CBOT July soybeans surge on supply, technicals.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBOT July soybeans surged higher Friday in fast trade on concerns about tight supplies and on technical buying, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;We blew through the 50-day (moving average) and then hit a lot of stops,&quot; said one floor trader.</p>
</text>
